I originally thought:

```text
prehistoric
→ historical armies
→ mythology
```

But after this research I would change the roadmap.

I think the strongest first expansion is:

```text
                         LIFE GRAPH

                         TAXONOMY
                            │
                      Open Tree of Life
                            │
                            ▼
                          SPECIES
                            │
          ┌─────────────────┼─────────────────┐
          ↓                 ↓                 ↓
        traits          occurrences      interactions
      TraitBank           GBIF/OBIS         GloBI
          │                 │                 │
          └─────────────────┼─────────────────┘
                            ▼
                         WORLD MODEL
                            │
                ┌───────────┼───────────┐
                ▼           ▼           ▼
