Instead of `AnimalAsset`, build:

```text
WorldEntity
│
├── identity
├── types[]
├── assertions[]
├── sources[]
├── relationships[]
│
├── temporal_extent
├── spatial_extent
│
├── capabilities[]
├── constraints[]
├── environments[]
│
├── visual_reconstructions[]
├── media_assets[]
│
├── simulation_models[]
└── uncertainty[]
```

Then:

```text
Titanoboa
Roman city
Nāga
exoplanet
deep-sea squid
volcano
ancient coin
```

are all **WorldEntity** instances.

Different domain plugins decide what can interact.

