# The deepest goldmine may be cross-world content

Once these world packs exist, you stop thinking in terms of channels.

You can compute unusual intersections:

```text
BIOLOGY × HISTORY

Which dangerous animals did Roman explorers encounter?
```

```text
HISTORY × CLIMATE

How did environmental change affect this settlement?
```

```text
MYTH × ARCHAEOLOGY

Where do representations of this creature first appear?
```

```text
PALEONTOLOGY × EVOLUTION

Why did this body plan disappear?
```

```text
ASTRONOMY × SIMULATION

What would Earth's sky look like in this planetary system?
```

The graph itself starts suggesting stories.

